@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userToken = replace_with_user_access_token
@adminToken = replace_with_admin_access_token
@orderId = 1

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/system/health

### Login as user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/auth/mock-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "模块开发人员",
  "accountType": "USER"
}

### Resources
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/resources?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Create order (replace skuId and use a new key for every new order)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: shared-order-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{"skuId": 5, "quantity": 1, "serviceDate": "2026-07-30", "timeSlot": ""}],
  "remark": "模块联调订单"
}

### Mock pay
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/orders/{{orderId}}/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: shared-payment-001

### Tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/orders/{{orderId}}/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Mock refund (only for a paid and unused order)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/app/orders/{{orderId}}/mock-refund
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: shared-refund-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"模块联调退款"}
